                <div className="text-pretty rich-text" style={{ "textAlign": "start" }} data-text-ready="">
                  <p>
                    <span data-kp-line="" data-kp-break="space" style={{ "display": "block", "whiteSpace": "nowrap", "wordSpacing": "2.55821px" }}>Moment is the AI operating system for investment management, built for the</span>
                    <span data-kp-line="" data-kp-break="space" style={{ "display": "block", "whiteSpace": "nowrap", "wordSpacing": "2.27844px" }}>world’s largest wealth firms and fintechs. Moment works with firms managing</span>
                    <span data-kp-line="" data-kp-break="space" style={{ "display": "block", "whiteSpace": "nowrap", "wordSpacing": "2.76367px" }}>more than $10 trillion in client assets, including Edward Jones, LPL Financial,</span>
                    <span data-kp-line="" data-kp-break="space" style={{ "display": "block", "whiteSpace": "nowrap", "wordSpacing": "2.20325px" }}>and Hightower Advisors. Founded by former quants and traders from Citadel</span>
                    <span data-kp-line="" data-kp-break="space" style={{ "display": "block", "whiteSpace": "nowrap", "wordSpacing": "0.17895px" }}>Securities, Moment is headquartered in New York City. The company has raised</span>
                    <span data-kp-line="" data-kp-break="space" style={{ "display": "block", "whiteSpace": "nowrap", "wordSpacing": "3.85022px" }}>$134 million in total funding and is backed by Index Ventures, Andreessen</span>
                    <span data-kp-line="" data-kp-break="end" style={{ "display": "block", "whiteSpace": "nowrap" }}>Horowitz, and Lightspeed Venture Partners.</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
